// native-only
// A panic of main as a green thread, after a sleep has started the scheduler and its monitor, ends the process with 1
// once it has taken the exit claim. The interpreter runs no sleep.
// expect-scheduler: used
// expect-exit: 1
//> slept

function main() returns ExitCode
	sleep(1)
	print("slept\n")
	panic("on a green thread")
end 'main'
